ght="44"><span><span class="nm">Tự Đức</span><span class="tp">1829–1883</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alexandra-feodorovna-alix-of-hesse"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alexandra-feodorovna-alix-of-hesse.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Alexandra Feodorovna (Alix of Hesse)</span><span class="tp">1872–1918</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alvaro-obregon"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alvaro-obregon.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Álvaro Obregón</span><span class="tp">1880–1928</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/draza-mihailovic"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/draza-mihailovic.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Draža Mihailović</span><span class="tp">1893–1946</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/edward-heath"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/edward-heath.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Edward Heath</span><span class="tp">1916–2005</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
